  "text_sample": "Your Page Title Services Projects Process About Blog Contact Overview Buy Rosewood Services Projects Process About Blog Contact [email protected] +00 00 00 00 00 Project Bathroom renovation A full bathroom transformation featuring modern tiling, sleek fixtures, improved lighting, and a layout optimised for comfort and usability. Service Bathrooms Location London Duration 6 weeks Completed November 2025 Before After The Challenge The original bathroom was dated, with inefficient use of space and poor lighting that made the room feel small and uninviting. The plumbing was also showing signs of age, with low water pressure and slow drainage. The client wanted a complete overhaul to create a spa-like retreat that would be both functional for the morning rush and relaxing for evening soaks. Our Solution We stripped the room back to the brickwork, allowing us to reconfigure the plumbing and electrical systems. By moving the bathtub and installing a wall-hung vanity, we significantly increased the available floor space. We installed a high-pressure rainfall shower system and a deep, freestanding soaking tub as the centerpiece of the room. Key Features Custom Tiling: Floor-to-ceiling porce",
